{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A dark comedy story featuring the legendary Iggy Pop, crafted by the writer of Witcher 3, Cyberpunk 2077, and The Blood of Dawnwalker. Rockbeasts is a role-playing management game that puts you in the shoes of a manager in the age of MTV, rock anthems, and bad haircuts</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/c342bf5c20a80c84f61ac2e81a3ae514.avif?t=1761249147\" width=616 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/49b89584db7f976d5b3ded254504f8a4.poster.avif?t=1761249147\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/49b89584db7f976d5b3ded254504f8a4.webm?t=1761249147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/49b89584db7f976d5b3ded254504f8a4.mp4?t=1761249147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>I\u2019d rather be dead than cool</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>-Kurt Cobain</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re changing the world of music. Your band\u2019s tracks are the kind of art that redefines genres. That\u2019s why you signed with a label that cares about creative freedom, right? You didn\u2019t become sellouts, did you?   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The road to success is a tricky one, and being a manager is a complex task. Will you help your band become rock rebels or sellouts? The choice is not always easy. ROCKBEASTS is set in the 90s United States, a time of grunge rock, raging capitalism, and music television.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/b93186b86cbe0dafced35747fd0ff102.avif?t=1761249147\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/f735dbac5ad437e300006997668df0fa.poster.avif?t=1761249147\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/f735dbac5ad437e300006997668df0fa.webm?t=1761249147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/f735dbac5ad437e300006997668df0fa.mp4?t=1761249147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>&quot;A kid once said to me \u201cdo you get hangovers\u201d I said, \u201cto get hangovers you have to stop drinking&quot; </i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>-Lemmy Kilmister</i>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somebody\u2019s gotta make sure this bunch of misfits get ready for the gig. That\u2019s where you come in. Make sure they get it together. There\u2019s real potential here, but you\u2019re gonna have to be the one that makes sure they make it through each week with a half-decent meal and a working amp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/86d56b554ca0d0d913964e5b2c1511f2.avif?t=1761249147\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/42e049e60e60b84f23e2eab9a3c25797.poster.avif?t=1761249147\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/42e049e60e60b84f23e2eab9a3c25797.webm?t=1761249147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/42e049e60e60b84f23e2eab9a3c25797.mp4?t=1761249147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>&quot;I won\u2019t be a rock star. I will be a legend.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>-Freddie Mercury</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick the venue, prep the set and make sure it all goes according to plan. Pull it off and the band might just finally take those first steps to fame and glory. Sure, this one was in a grimy basement, but even the rock legends had to start somewhere, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/48dc9be4675f8b5784ed597a8e36acee.avif?t=1761249147\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We drew over 100 characters and 90 locations just for you! Rockbeasts is no EP, it\u2019s a full double LP. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every one of those characters is real, the choices you make will impact them. Your band members will change in time and so will your relationship with them. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In ROCKBEASTS, the tough choices as manager will be yours. Write your own rockstar legend where your decisions will shape the story.&quot; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring VO actors from games including Baldur\u2019s Gate 3, Cyberpunk 2077, Horizon Zero Dawn, Metaphor ReFantazio, Alan Wake II and more.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1445880?t=1761249147","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/c9f9b5ea71db5cf7c2abfa216cd5fff9ab804da5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761249147","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/9c3c8170963ef55f4d94b56e725e0e75fa145dbc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761249147","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/9c3c8170963ef55f4d94b56e725e0e75fa145dbc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761249147","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Bad language\r\nTobacco and alcohol reference/use\r\nIllegal drug references\r\nSexual references"},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A dark comedy story featuring the legendary Iggy Pop, crafted by the writer of Witcher 3, Cyberpunk 2077, and The Blood of Dawnwalker. Rockbeasts is a role-playing management game that puts you in the shoes of a manager in the age of MTV, rock anthems, and bad haircuts</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/c342bf5c20a80c84f61ac2e81a3ae514.avif?t=1761249147\" width=616 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/49b89584db7f976d5b3ded254504f8a4.poster.avif?t=1761249147\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/49b89584db7f976d5b3ded254504f8a4.webm?t=1761249147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/49b89584db7f976d5b3ded254504f8a4.mp4?t=1761249147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>I\u2019d rather be dead than cool</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>-Kurt Cobain</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re changing the world of music. Your band\u2019s tracks are the kind of art that redefines genres. That\u2019s why you signed with a label that cares about creative freedom, right? You didn\u2019t become sellouts, did you?   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The road to success is a tricky one, and being a manager is a complex task. Will you help your band become rock rebels or sellouts? The choice is not always easy. ROCKBEASTS is set in the 90s United States, a time of grunge rock, raging capitalism, and music television.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/b93186b86cbe0dafced35747fd0ff102.avif?t=1761249147\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/f735dbac5ad437e300006997668df0fa.poster.avif?t=1761249147\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/f735dbac5ad437e300006997668df0fa.webm?t=1761249147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/f735dbac5ad437e300006997668df0fa.mp4?t=1761249147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>&quot;A kid once said to me \u201cdo you get hangovers\u201d I said, \u201cto get hangovers you have to stop drinking&quot; </i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>-Lemmy Kilmister</i>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somebody\u2019s gotta make sure this bunch of misfits get ready for the gig. That\u2019s where you come in. Make sure they get it together. There\u2019s real potential here, but you\u2019re gonna have to be the one that makes sure they make it through each week with a half-decent meal and a working amp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/86d56b554ca0d0d913964e5b2c1511f2.avif?t=1761249147\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/42e049e60e60b84f23e2eab9a3c25797.poster.avif?t=1761249147\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/42e049e60e60b84f23e2eab9a3c25797.webm?t=1761249147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/42e049e60e60b84f23e2eab9a3c25797.mp4?t=1761249147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>&quot;I won\u2019t be a rock star. I will be a legend.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>-Freddie Mercury</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick the venue, prep the set and make sure it all goes according to plan. Pull it off and the band might just finally take those first steps to fame and glory. Sure, this one was in a grimy basement, but even the rock legends had to start somewhere, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/48dc9be4675f8b5784ed597a8e36acee.avif?t=1761249147\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We drew over 100 characters and 90 locations just for you! Rockbeasts is no EP, it\u2019s a full double LP. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every one of those characters is real, the choices you make will impact them. Your band members will change in time and so will your relationship with them. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In ROCKBEASTS, the tough choices as manager will be yours. Write your own rockstar legend where your decisions will shape the story.&quot; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring VO actors from games including Baldur\u2019s Gate 3, Cyberpunk 2077, Horizon Zero Dawn, Metaphor ReFantazio, Alan Wake II and more.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Lichthund"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/a8bc64146ec88f438e26ff629bb95271ca4319a9/header.jpg?t=1761249147","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Rockbeasts \u00a9 Lichthund, published under licence by Team17 Digital Limited.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1445880/332045796/a562e571bfce309576ce78856925eca7c06716fe/1761040913/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761249145","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1445880/332045796/a562e571bfce309576ce78856925eca7c06716fe/1